{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261124/photo/bkn-20261124090447042-1124_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261124091825\"/><p>貨車車頭嚴重損毀。</p><p>吐露港公路發生交通意外。今日(24日)早上8時59分，一輛貨車沿路往粉嶺方向行駛，至近大埔運頭塘邨對開時與一輛泥頭車相撞，貨車車頭嚴重損毀，途經駕駛人士恐有人被困代為報案。救援人員接報到場將傷者救出，交救護車送院治理，肇事原因有待警員調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T01:34:26.859727+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T01:04:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T09:17:15.557516+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T01:28:00.702481+00:00","content_hash":"3a259eb914a4bf4968a69489c7ff897e3ed11546447f542ff3f7ba0741a4c979","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T01:34:26.859727+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}